  "default/31688-4.htm": {
   "file": "default/31688-4.htm",
   "quest": null,
   "text": "Grand Olympiad Manager: The Olympiad boasts a long history. During the mythical era of giants, this arena was created to foster peace and understanding among the races. This is the Grand Olympiad.",
   "header": "Grand Olympiad Manager",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Back",
     "bypass": "npc_%objectId%_Chat 1",
     "kind": "page",
     "to": "default/31688-1.htm"
    }
   ]
  },
  "default/31688-5.htm": {
   "file": "default/31688-5.htm",
   "quest": null,
   "text": "Grand Olympiad Manager: The Olympiad match can be generally divided by three types. One is a 3 vs. 3 Team Match where 3 people become a team to compete with other teams, one is a 1 vs. 1 Match where 1:1 competition is held regardless of the class, one is a 1 vs. 1 Class Match where a person can com…",
   "header": "Grand Olympiad Manager",
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Back",
     "bypass": "npc_%objectId%_Chat 1",
     "kind": "page",
     "to": "default/31688-1.htm"
    }
   ]
  },
  "default/31688-6.htm": {
   "file": "default/31688-6.htm",
   "quest": null,
   "text": "Grand Olympiad Manager: You must earn Grand Olympiad Points in order to become a hero. The person who acquires the most points in each class is selected to become the hero of that period. If you participate in a certain number of games, you can also exchange Grand Olympiad Points for Olympiad Token…",
   "header": "Grand Olympiad Manager",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Back",
     "bypass": "npc_%objectId%_Chat 1",
     "kind": "page",
     "to": "default/31688-1.htm"
    }
   ]
  },
  "default/31688-7.htm": {
   "file": "default/31688-7.htm",
   "quest": null,
   "text": "Grand Olympiad Manager: Once the Olympiad period ends, Olympiad Points are awarded to participating Noblesse. In order to exchange Olympiad Points for Olympiad Tokens, you must first participate in at least 15 matches. You can exchange 1 Olympiad Point for 1,000 Olympiad Tokens. For example, if you…",
   "header": "Grand Olympiad Manager",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Back",
     "bypass": "npc_%objectId%_Chat 1",
     "kind": "page",
     "to": "default/31688-1.htm"
    }
   ]
  },
